## GitHub Access

A repo-scoped token is available at `.gh-token`. Use it for all GitHub operations:

```bash
GH_TOKEN=$(cat .gh-token) gh pr create --title "feat: description" --body "..." --base main
```

Do **not** use `gh auth login` or any other token — `.gh-token` is scoped to this repository only.

